ive nor irreflexive, we require that some nodes (vertices) have a loop and some don't. Among the given options, only digraph III has this property:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-de1d22d5d36b769d76f25c9a8318041c\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/de1d22d5d36b769d76f25c9a8318041c\"></div> \n\n<p>Notice that the nodes <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.808ex\" height=\"2.509ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.505ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -863.1 778.5 1080.4\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-10-Title\">\\spadesuit</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E10-MJMAIN-2660\" d=\"M181 -21Q134 -21 96 27T55 193Q55 224 58 247T82 317T143 410Q172 443 234 498Q282 543 314 598T360 687T380 725Q386 727 389 727Q395 727 398 725T406 716T413 702T423 677T439 641Q481 556 544 498Q633 420 678 353T723 204Q723 142 711 94T669 12T590 -21Q520 -21 490 8T459 66V70H409V62Q409 22 416 -17T430 -82T437 -112Q437 -131 407 -131Q403 -131 397 -131T389 -130T382 -130T372 -131Q341 -131 341 -111Q341 -107 348 -82T362 -18T369 62V70H319V66Q319 57 314 44T297 16T257 -10T191 -21H181Z\"></path>\n</defs>\n<g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n <use xlink:href=\"#E10-MJMAIN-2660\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\"></use>\n</g>\n</svg></span> and <span class=\"mjpage\"><svg xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\" width=\"1.808ex\" height=\"2.176ex\" style=\"vertical-align: -0.338ex;\" viewBox=\"0 -791.3 778.5 936.9\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-labelledby=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">\n<title id=\"MathJax-SVG-11-Title\">\\heartsuit</title>\n<defs aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<path stroke-width=\"1\" id=\"E11-MJMAIN-2661\" d=\"M55 490Q55 557 71 604T114 674T167 706T222 716Q279 716 322 684T389 605Q391 610 395 617T414 643T447 677T494 704T555 716Q642 71